    <description>When an Opportunity moves to Closed Won, creates an Asset for each product line with Track as Asset ticked (hardware, licenses, annual services), so the account shows its installed base. Labor, implementations and training aren&apos;t tracked and are skipped. The work is in the OpportunityAssets Apex class.</description>
